DIMENSIONS AUTHOR CHECK
Author Check Technical Guide
Last updated October 2026
This guide explains the data behind Dimensions Author Check: the terms it uses, how each indicator works, where the data comes from, and how common each indicator is. For step-by-step help using the app, see the Author Check User Guide.
HOW TO USE THIS GUIDE
* Need a definition? Start with Section 1.
* Want to know what an indicator measures and why it matters? See Section 2.
* Want to know where a flag comes from? See Section 3.
* Want to know how common an indicator is? See Section 4.


AN INDICATOR IS NOT A VERDICT
The indicators in Author Check are not “metrics” that can be used for benchmarking, and none of them can determine misconduct by themself. A highlight means “worth a closer look”, not “this person has done something wrong.”
